  "raw_text": "{\"changes\":[{\"path\":\"python_programs/next_palindrome.py\",\"new_content\":\"def next_palindrome(digit_list):\\n    n = len(digit_list)\\n    # Work on the left half (including the middle element for odd length)\\n    # and mirror it to the right side, incrementing the midpoint like an adder.\\n    high_mid = n // 2\\n    low_mid = (n - 1) // 2\\n    while high_mid < n and low_mid >= 0:\\n        if digit_list[high_mid] == 9:\\n            digit_list[high_mid] = 0\\n            digit_list[low_mid] = 0\\n            high_mid += 1\\n            low_mid -= 1\\n        else:\\n            digit_list[high_mid] += 1\\n            if low_mid != high_mid:\\n                digit_list[low_mid] += 1\\n            # mirror the modified left half onto the right half\\n            for i in range(n // 2):\\n                digit_list[n - 1 - i] = digit_list[i]\\n            return digit_list\\n    # All digits were 9: result length grows by 1\\n    return [1] + (n - 1) * [0] + [1]\\n\"},{\"path\":\"python_programs/next_palindrome.py\",\"edits\":[{\"old\":\"    # All digits were 9: result length grows by 1\\n    return [1] + (n - 1) * [0] + [1]\",\"new\":\"    # All digits were 9: result length grows by 1\\n    return [1] + (n - 1) * [0] + [1]\"}]}],\"explanation\":\"修复next_palindrome：在进位后按左侧（含中点）更新并将右半镜像覆盖，保证结果是最小的下一个回文；全9时长度仅增长1，返回[1]+(n-1)个0+[1]。原实现未镜像右半且全9分支长度错误（增长2）。\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"test-development-2\"],\"knowledge_citations\":[\"knowledge-public_tasks\",\"knowledge-testing\"]}",
